cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BLADE in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "BLADE: Boride Lattice Automated Discovery Engine"
version: 1.7.0
date-released: "2026-09-29"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/ichasekatz/BLADE"
doi: "TODO: add Zenodo DOI after first release"
url: "https://github.com/ichasekatz/BLADE"
abstract: >
  BLADE is a high-throughput Python framework for automated CALPHAD TDB generation,
  SQS structure creation via ATAT, MLIP-based structural relaxation, and
  oxidation-stability analysis for multi-component boride and alloy systems.
  The thermodynamic equilibrium solver and Gibbs free energy minimization are
  contributed by Siya Zhu.
